Done  SSL     prefix  ext     target

✓     80      ✗       fr      → SSL www com /fr
✓     80      www     fr      → SSL www com /fr
✓     443     ✗       fr      → SSL www com /fr
✓     443     www     fr      → SSL www com /fr
✓     80      ✗       com     → SSL www com
✓     80      www     com     → SSL www com
✓     443     ✗       com     → SSL www com
✓     443     www     com     → PS

      80      blog    fr      → SSL blog com (/fr ?)
      443     blog    fr      → SSL blog com (/fr ?)
      80      blog    com     → SSL blog com
      443     blog    com     → WP


